    "en": {
      "trackName": "JumpJump - Watch Game",
      "description": "A lightweight jumping game made for Apple Watch.\nPress and hold to charge, then release to jump. Control your power and rhythm as you leap across platforms with\ndifferent styles and aim for a higher score.\nThe game includes multiple platform designs and unlockable skins, with simple controls and a brisk pace that\nfits short play sessions perfectly.\nRaise your wrist and play anytime for a quick, arcade-like jumping experience.\n\nHow to Play:\n• Press and hold the screen to charge.\n• Release the screen to jump automatically.\n• The longer you charge, the farther you jump.\n• Land safely on a platform to keep going.\n• Precise landings earn higher scores.\n• If you fall, the run ends.",
      "releaseNotes": "Added the iPhone version of JumpJump, now playable on iPhone and Apple Watch.",
